+ * imports the GPU only reads: no-copy buffers over memory the owner maps read-only (Core Animation's render server over its clients'
+ * shared memory, mapped files), which the bridge's surface bracket never reaches (the runtime joins a live import of the same pages, or
+ * imports them as a no-copy buffer first). Their pages are written before they are handed over and are cleaned when mapped; upstream's
+ * bridge clients leave them to that clean too (GpuProbe.cpp: native_adreno_readonly_imports_owned). native_adreno_ro_imports_owned
+ * (board: guamp-adreno-ro-imports-owned, default 1; 0 = cleaned at every submission as before) leaves them out, and every
