+ * owner did rewrite in place is stale for a bounded time. native_adreno_publish_ro_owned: [0] mappings left out, [1] their bytes,
+ * [2] sweeps. (fin44's "306326 KiB each" also counted write-combined BOs, which need and got no maintenance: now only maintained bytes.) */
